;━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
;混线取得后处理状态
;混線處理狀態號
;━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
[Statedef 515000]
type = U
movetype = U
physics = U
hitdefpersist = 1
movehitpersist = 1

[State ];狀態號變更
type = ChangeState
trigger1 = ishelper(777777777);C1Anim探查helper
value = 777777777;C1Anim探查狀態號
ignorehitpause = 1

[State ];狀態號變更
type = ChangeState
trigger1 = ishelper(777777778);C2Anim探查helper
value = 777777778;C2Anim探查狀態號
ignorehitpause = 1

[State ];狀態號變更
type = ChangeState
trigger1 = parent,ishelper(777777778);helperID偽裝helper
value = 777777779;helperID偽裝狀態號
ignorehitpause = 1

[State ];狀態變更
type = statetypeset
trigger1 = ishelper
movetype = I;閒置
physics = N;重力、摩擦無視
ignorehitpause = 1

[State ];消除Explod
type = RemoveExplod
trigger1 = 1
IgnoreHitPause = 1

[State ];特殊斷言
type = Assertspecial
trigger1 = 1
flag = invisible;不可見
flag2 = noshadow;無影子
ignorehitpause = 1

[State ];無敵，防止被干擾
type = Nothitby
trigger1 = 1
value = SCA
ignorehitpause = 1

[State ];power封殺
type = PowerSet
trigger1 = 1
value = 0
ignorehitpause = 1

;间者
[State , 間者Helper];攻擊動畫檢索間者
type = Helper
triggerall = numhelper(777777777) = 0;不存在時
triggerall = ishelper;helper執行
triggerall = playeridexist(id);消除召喚對策
trigger1 = roundstate < 3;戰鬥結束前
ID = 777777777
name = "spy-C1anim"
postype = p1
pos = 0, 500;埋在地下
stateno = 1000 * random
helpertype = normal;重要定義，若為player型則有可能被敵方代碼影響
size.xscale = 0;x軸大小
size.yscale = 0;y軸大小
keyctrl = 0;不可控
pausemovetime = 2147483647;無視時止
supermovetime = 2147483647;無視時止
ignorehitpause = 1;打擊暫停中可執行

[State , 間者Helper];受擊動畫檢索間者
type = Helper
triggerall = numhelper(777777778) = 0
triggerall = ishelper
triggerall = playeridexist(id)
trigger1 = roundstate < 3
ID = 777777778
name = "spy-C2anim"
postype = p1
pos = 0, 500
stateno = 1000 * random
helpertype = normal
size.xscale = 0
size.yscale = 0
keyctrl = 0
pausemovetime = 2147483647
supermovetime = 2147483647
ignorehitpause = 1

;helper操作
;本體間者製作
[state ,攻擊動畫]
type = changeanim2
trigger1 = parent,ID = root,ID ;本體為親
trigger1 = ishelper
trigger1 =!(root,numprojID(1000045) && root,numprojID(1000046));還未製作本體間者
trigger1 =!hitpausetime
value = 10001
ignorehitpause = 1

[state ,狀態]
type = statetypeset
trigger1 = parent,ID = root,ID
trigger1 = ishelper
trigger1 =!(root,numprojID(1000045) && root,numprojID(1000046))
trigger1 =!hitpausetime;
statetype = C
movetype = A;攻擊狀態
ignorehitpause = 1

[state ,凍結獲取];取得凍結,以進行512溢出刷值
type = hitdef
trigger1 = parent,ID = root,ID
trigger1 = ishelper
trigger1 =!(root,numprojID(1000045) && root,numprojID(1000046))
trigger1 =!hitpausetime
attr = ,HP
pausetime = 4,0
numhits = 0
sparkno = -1
hitsound = -1
ignorehitpause = 1

;確定helper類型，以防normal化時出錯
[State ,player or normal?]
type = LifeSet
trigger1 = parent,ID = root,ID
trigger1 = hitpausetime	
value = LifeMax
ignorehitpause=1

[state ,player or normal?]
type = lifeset
trigger1 = parent,ID = root,ID
trigger1 = hitpausetime	
value = 0
ignorehitpause = 1

[state ,防止事故]
type = targetdrop
trigger1 = ishelper
ignorehitpause = 1

[state , normal化]
type = changestate
trigger1 = parent,ID = root,ID;親為本體，製作本體間者
trigger1 = ishelper
trigger1 =!root,numprojID(1000045);還未進行normal化
trigger1 = hitpausetime > 1
value = 1000045
ignorehitpause = 1

[state , ID變更]
type = changestate
trigger1 = parent,ID = root,ID;親為本體，製作本體間者
trigger1 = ishelper
trigger1 =!root,numprojID(1000046);還未進行helperID變更
trigger1 =!!life;確定為normal型
trigger1 = hitpausetime > 1
value = 1000046
ignorehitpause = 1

;潘朵拉殺手改
[State ]
type = Parentvarset
triggerall = roundstate = 2
triggerall = ishelper
triggerall = root,alive
triggerall = parent,ID = root,ID
trigger1 = ceil(enemy,fvar(1))%5000 = [0,1999]
trigger2 = ceil(enemy,fvar(1))%5000 = [3600,3999]
var(ceil(enemy,fvar(2))) = root,stateno
ignorehitpause = 1

;本體gametime貫通
[state , 整數gt貫通砲1]
type = parentvarset
triggerall = root,alive;本體存活
triggerall = parent,id = root,id;親為本體
triggerall = playeridexist(ceil(enemy,fvar(6)));gametime貫通調查helper存在
triggerall = (playerid(ceil(enemy,fvar(6))),var(38)&63) || playerid(ceil(enemy,fvar(6))),var(40) || playerid(ceil(enemy,fvar(6))),var(41) || playerid(ceil(enemy,fvar(6))),var(42) || playerid(ceil(enemy,fvar(6))),var(43)
trigger1 = ceil(enemy,fvar(1))%5000 = [200,299]
trigger2 = ceil(enemy,fvar(1))%5000 = [600,1199]
trigger3 = ceil(enemy,fvar(1))%5000 = [2000,3599]
v = (playerid(ceil(enemy,fvar(6))),var(38)&63)
value = ((gametime+1)**3)*(playerid(ceil(enemy,fvar(6))),var(40)) + ((gametime+1)**2)*(playerid(ceil(enemy,fvar(6))),var(41)) + (gametime+1)*playerid(ceil(enemy,fvar(6))),var(42) + playerid(ceil(enemy,fvar(6))),var(43)
ignorehitpause = 1

